@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@applicationId = aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee
@tenantId = cccccccc-dddd-eeee-ffff-000000000001

### Math Dynamic APIs — setup (GET + POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestDynamicApi/SetupMathDynamicApis

### Math multiply/divide (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicApi/Get/math-multiply-divide-get?a=6&b=3

### Math multiply/divide (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicApi/Post/math-multiply-divide-post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "a": 6,
  "b": 3
}

### Currency Dynamic APIs — setup (datagrid + by id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestDynamicApi/SetupCurrencyDynamicApis

### Currency list (datagrid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicApi/Get/currency-get-currencies?pageStart=0&pageSize=10

### Currency by id (replace with a real currency id from your DB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicApi/Get/currency-get-currency?id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Simple currency list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestDynamicApi/SetupCurrencyDynamicApi

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicApi/Get/currency-list

### CRUD + Dynamic API pipeline — single setup (PostgreSQL required)
# Correlation header yoksa endpoint sample ApplicationId/TenantId ile correlation otomatik doldurur.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestCrudDynamicApi/SetupSampleNotesCrudAndDynamicApi

### Read CRUD table via Dynamic API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicApi/Get/sample-notes-list

### Add a note via CRUD runtime
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/base/Crud/Save/sample-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Title": "Note from http-examples.http"
}

### CRUD list
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/base/Crud/GetList/sample-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Dynamic Export — setup currencies first, then create export job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestDynamicApi/SetupCurrencyDynamicApis

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestDynamicApi/CreateCurrencyExportRequest

### Poll export status (replace exportRequestId from previous response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicExporter/GetExportRequest?id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Download export (when status is Ready)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/base/DynamicExporter/Download?id=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
